{"type":"message","id":"baa1cf04","parentId":"29a871e6","timestamp":"2026-03-04T11:21:39.723Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"项目结构清晰。现在启动 review-agent 进行深度代码分析，定位发散原因。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"项目结构已了解。启动 **review-agent** 进行深度代码分析："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-218f98fa37c2400d85382e64710840ed","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"agentId":"review-agent","mode":"run","runTimeoutSeconds":600,"task":"## Task: 分析 ParMETIS 剖分后 CFD 计算发散的原因\n\n## Workspace: /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter\n\n## Context\n用户反馈 ParMETIS 算法剖分完后，CFD 计算发散了。这是 P0 功能性 bug。\n\n## 项目结构\n- src/metisCutter.cpp / metisCutter.h — ParMETIS 剖分实现\n- src/meshCutter.cpp / meshCutter.h — 剖分基类\n- src/mpiAdapter.cpp / mpiAdapter.h — MPI 通信\n- src/cgFile.cpp / cgFile.h — CGNS 文件处理\n\n## 分析重点\n1. **Interface 数据交换** — 检查分区边界数据是否完整传递\n2. **网格剖分边界处理** — 检查边界单元、面的处理逻辑\n3. **负载均衡** — 检查是否有数据丢失\n4. **最近的修改** — 检查 git log 是否有引入 bug 的改动\n\n## 具体检查项\n1. `metisCutter.cpp` 中的 `partition()` 函数：\n   - Interface 构建是否完整？\n   - 边界单元是否正确标记？\n   - Ghost cell 是否正确处理？\n\n2. MPI 通信逻辑：\n   - 数据交换是否完整？\n   - 是否有竞态条件？\n\n3. 与 cartesianCutter 对比：\n   - 为什么 cartesianCutter 不发散？\n   - ParMETIS 特有的问题在哪？\n\n## Deliverable\n**问题定位报告**，包含：\n1. 根因分析（最可能的原因）\n2. 具体代码位置（文件:行号）\n3. 修复建议\n\n## Report To: $HOME/.openclaw-reports/review-agent/"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":912,"output":464,"cacheRead":16749,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18125,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772623287677}}
